               <code code="34069-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HOW SUPPLIED SECTION"/>
               <title>16 HOW SUPPLIED/STORAGE AND HANDLING</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Dehydrated alcohol injection, USP is a clear, colorless liquid supplied in clear, glass, single-dose vials. Each mL contains ≥ 99% by volume ethyl alcohol.</paragraph>
