                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td align="justify" styleCode="Lrule Rrule Botrule Toprule" valign="middle">16729-710-53</td>
                           <td align="justify" styleCode="Rrule Botrule Toprule" valign="middle">5 x 5 mL Single-Dose Vials</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td align="justify" styleCode="Lrule Rrule " valign="middle">16729-710-45</td>
                           <td align="justify" styleCode="Rrule" valign="middle">10 x 5 mL Single-Dose Vials</td>
                        </tr>
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
                  <paragraph>Store at room temperature, between 20°C and 25°C (68°F and 77°F). Do not refrigerate or freeze. Highly flammable, store away from any heat source.</paragraph>
